#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:2
msgid "Deploy for Mission Partner Collaboration"
msgstr "임무 파트너 협업을 위한 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mission partner collaboration extends :doc:`sovereign collaboration "
"</deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-"
"sovereign-collaboration>` and :doc:`edge deployment </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations>` "
"models to enable joint and allied operations across organizations using "
"Mattermost, Microsoft 365 and legacy platforms. The solution architecture"
" outlined in this document delivers a secure, sovereign, and intelligent "
"mission environment that is federated across enterprise and coalition "
"partner networks, enabling interoperability while maintaining compliance "
"and control."
msgstr ""
"임무 파트너 협업은 :doc:`주권적 협업 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration>` 및 :doc:`엣지 배포 "
"</deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-"
"operations>` 모델을 확장하여, OKR.BEST, Microsoft 365, 레거시 플랫폼을 사용하는 "
"조직 전반에 걸쳐 연합 및 동맹 작전을 가능하게 합니다. 이 문서에서 설명하는 솔루션 "
"아키텍처는 엔터프라이즈 및 연합 파트너 네트워크 전반에 페더레이션되어 규정 준수와 "
"제어를 유지하면서 상호 운용성을 가능하게 하는 안전하고 주권적이며 지능적인 임무 "
"환경을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:9
msgid ""
"Joint mission collaboration is achieved through federation using "
":doc:`connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>`, `Matrix connectors <https://mattermost.com/marketplace"
"/mattermost-matrix-connector/>`_, :doc:`guest accounts </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`, and `auto-translation "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-translations>`_ "
"for fast, accurate comprehension across globally distributed teams. "
"Additionally, integrating external data feeds, workflow automation, and "
"sovereign AI enables allied and partner users to collaborate at mission "
"speed while enforcing zero-trust policies and maintaining data "
"sovereignty."
msgstr ""
"연합 임무 협업은 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 </administration-guide/onboard"
"/connected-workspaces>`, `Matrix 커넥터 <https://mattermost.com/marketplace"
"/mattermost-matrix-connector/>`_, :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-guide"
"/onboard/guest-accounts>`, 그리고 전 세계에 분산된 팀 전반에서 빠르고 정확한 "
"이해를 위한 `자동 번역 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-"
"translations>`_\\ 을 사용한 페더레이션을 통해 달성됩니다. 또한 외부 데이터 피드, "
"워크플로 자동화, 주권적 AI를 통합하면 동맹 및 파트너 사용자가 제로 트러스트 "
"정책을 시행하고 데이터 주권을 유지하면서 임무 속도로 협업할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:11
msgid ""
"Mattermost deployments may be hosted on-premises or in sovereign clouds, "
"enabling allies and partners to retain control over sensitive data while "
"extending interoperability to coalition partner enterprise networks."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 배포는 온프레미스 또는 주권 클라우드에 호스팅할 수 있어, 동맹과 파트너가 "
"민감한 데이터에 대한 제어권을 유지하면서 연합 파트너 엔터프라이즈 네트워크로 상호 "
"운용성을 확장할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:14
msgid "Collaboration challenges"
msgstr "협업 과제"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:16
msgid "Multi-agency collaborations face complex communication challenges:"
msgstr "다기관 협업은 복잡한 통신 과제에 직면합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Platform diversity:** Organizations often use different platforms, "
"including Microsoft 365, Mattermost, and Matrix - with some using Teams "
"for enterprise productivity :doc:`supplemented with Mattermost "
"</deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-"
"sovereign-collaboration>` for sovereign collaboration, data residency, "
"and offline resilience."
msgstr ""
"**플랫폼 다양성:** 조직은 종종 Microsoft 365, OKR.BEST, Matrix 등 서로 다른 "
"플랫폼을 사용하며, 일부는 엔터프라이즈 생산성을 위해 Teams를 사용하고 주권적 "
"협업, 데이터 거주지, 오프라인 복원력을 위해 :doc:`OKR.BEST로 보완 </deployment-"
"guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-"
"collaboration>`\\ 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:19
msgid ""
"**External access:** External partners need controlled access without "
"full organizational membership."
msgstr ""
"**외부 접근:** 외부 파트너는 조직의 정식 멤버십 없이 제어된 접근이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:20
msgid "**Language barriers:** Organizations may speak different languages."
msgstr "**언어 장벽:** 조직마다 서로 다른 언어를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Compliance:** Data residency and compliance requirements vary across "
"organizations."
msgstr ""
"**규정 준수:** 데이터 거주지 및 규정 준수 요구 사항은 조직마다 다릅니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:24
msgid "Solution Architecture"
msgstr "솔루션 아키텍처"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:26
msgid ""
"Traditional solutions require everyone to adopt the same platform or use "
"insecure external tools. Mattermost powers a multi-layer approach "
"addressing these collaboration challenges and diverse organizational "
"needs, including:"
msgstr ""
"전통적인 솔루션은 모두가 동일한 플랫폼을 채택하거나 안전하지 않은 외부 도구를 "
"사용하도록 요구합니다. OKR.BEST는 이러한 협업 과제와 다양한 조직의 요구를 "
"해결하는 다계층 접근 방식을 구동하며, 다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Mattermost ↔ Mattermost Collaboration:** Organizations with Mattermost "
"deployments establish secure connections and share specific channels "
"using :doc:`connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard"
"/connected-workspaces>` over standard HTTPS/VPN."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST ↔ OKR.BEST 협업:** OKR.BEST 배포를 보유한 조직은 표준 HTTPS/VPN을 "
"통해 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>`\\ 를 사용하여 안전한 연결을 구축하고 특정 채널을 공유합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:30
msgid ""
"**External users ↔ Mattermost Collaboration:** Users from external "
"organizations receive Mattermost :doc:`guest accounts </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` with least-privilege access. External "
"users in Microsoft environments may access Mattermost using the "
":doc:`embedded application </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>` in their Teams and Outlook clients."
msgstr ""
"**외부 사용자 ↔ OKR.BEST 협업:** 외부 조직의 사용자는 최소 권한 접근이 적용된 "
"OKR.BEST :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`\\ 을 "
"받습니다. Microsoft 환경의 외부 사용자는 Teams 및 Outlook 클라이언트의 "
":doc:`내장 애플리케이션 </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>`\\ 을 사용하여 OKR.BEST에 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Matrix / XMPP ↔ Mattermost Collaboration:** Organizations using legacy "
"XMPP systems or Matrix servers connect to Mattermost via the `Matrix "
"bridge plugin <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-"
"bridge>`_ for bidirectional communication."
msgstr ""
"**Matrix / XMPP ↔ OKR.BEST 협업:** 레거시 XMPP 시스템이나 Matrix 서버를 "
"사용하는 조직은 양방향 통신을 위해 `Matrix 브리지 플러그인 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-bridge>`_\\ 을 통해 "
"OKR.BEST에 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Automatic Language Translation:** The AI-powered `automatic translation"
" plugin <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-"
"translations>`_ enables seamless communication across language barriers "
"in channels with distributed teams."
msgstr ""
"**자동 언어 번역:** AI 기반 `자동 번역 플러그인 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-translations>`_\\ 은 "
"분산된 팀이 있는 채널에서 언어 장벽을 넘어 매끄러운 통신을 가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:37
msgid ""
"Mattermost diagram displays the deployment components and relationships "
"outlined in detail in this document."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 다이어그램은 이 문서에서 자세히 설명하는 배포 구성 요소와 관계를 "
"보여줍니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:41
msgid ""
"Consider `talking to a Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`__ if your organization needs support deploying Mattermost and "
"supporting services for mission partner collaboration."
msgstr ""
"조직이 임무 파트너 협업을 위해 OKR.BEST 및 지원 서비스를 배포하는 데 도움이 "
"필요하다면 `Mattermost 전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`__\\ 하는 것을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:44
msgid "Architecture components"
msgstr "아키텍처 구성 요소"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:46
msgid "The deployment architecture includes the following components:"
msgstr "이 배포 아키텍처는 다음 구성 요소를 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Allied or Partner Networks:** Globally distributed and segregated "
"networks for each allied or partner organization."
msgstr ""
"**동맹 또는 파트너 네트워크:** 각 동맹 또는 파트너 조직을 위한 전 세계에 분산되고 "
"분리된 네트워크입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:50
msgid ""
"Networks may have a firewall or access gateway protecting egress and "
"ingress, such as network policies, IP allowlists, or WAFs depending on "
"networking configurations."
msgstr ""
"네트워크는 네트워킹 구성에 따라 네트워크 정책, IP 허용 목록, WAF 등 이그레스와 "
"인그레스를 보호하는 방화벽이나 접근 게이트웨이를 가질 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:51
msgid ""
"Networks may :doc:`operate in contested environments </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations>` "
"where internet connectivity is intermittent."
msgstr ""
"네트워크는 인터넷 연결이 간헐적인 :doc:`경쟁 환경에서 운영 </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations>`\\ 될 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Users:** Enterprise, allied, and coalition partner users accessing "
"client applications for Mattermost and/or Microsoft 365."
msgstr ""
"**사용자:** OKR.BEST 및/또는 Microsoft 365용 클라이언트 애플리케이션에 접근하는 "
"엔터프라이즈, 동맹, 연합 파트너 사용자입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID (Identity Provider):** Partnered organizations using"
" Microsoft 365 services may use :doc:`single sign-on Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>` for unified authentication "
"to M365 and Mattermost applications. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID(ID 공급자):** Microsoft 365 서비스를 사용하는 파트너 "
"조직은 M365 및 OKR.BEST 애플리케이션에 대한 통합 인증을 위해 :doc:`Entra ID 싱글 "
"사인온 </administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ 을 사용할 수 있습니다. "
"*(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:57
msgid "**Federation Services:**"
msgstr "**페더레이션 서비스:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Connected workspaces:** :doc:`Federated collaboration </administration-"
"guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>` across partner networks, with "
"seamless synchronization of messages, threads, and files."
msgstr ""
"**연결된 워크스페이스:** 메시지, 스레드, 파일의 매끄러운 동기화와 함께 파트너 "
"네트워크 전반에 걸친 :doc:`페더레이션 협업 </administration-guide/onboard"
"/connected-workspaces>`\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Guest Accounts:** :doc:`Secure participation </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` of external mission partners with least-"
"privilege access. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**게스트 계정:** 최소 권한 접근이 적용된 외부 임무 파트너의 :doc:`안전한 참여 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`\\ 입니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Matrix & XMPP Interoperability:** `Federation with legacy partner "
"systems <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-bridge>`_"
" for cross-domain coalition collaboration. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**Matrix 및 XMPP 상호 운용성:** 도메인 간 연합 협업을 위한 `레거시 파트너 "
"시스템과의 페더레이션 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-"
"bridge>`_\\ 입니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:63
msgid "**Client Applications:**"
msgstr "**클라이언트 애플리케이션:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Desktop Apps:** Access Mattermost directly by deploying "
":doc:`desktop </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` or web "
"apps in your organization."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱:** 조직에 :doc:`데스크톱 </deployment-guide/desktop"
"/desktop-app-deployment>` 또는 웹 앱을 배포하여 OKR.BEST에 직접 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Mobile Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`iPhone and "
"Android apps </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`, with "
"support for :doc:`ID-only push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/host-your-own-push-proxy-service>` to ensure compliance with data "
"sovereignty requirements. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 모바일 앱:** :doc:`iPhone 및 Android 앱 </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-app-deployment>`\\ 을 통해 OKR.BEST에 접근하며, 데이터 주권 요구 사항 "
"준수를 보장하기 위해 :doc:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 </deployment-guide/mobile/host-"
"your-own-push-proxy-service>`\\ 을 지원합니다. *(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Microsoft 365 Desktop Apps:** For partnered organizations using "
"Microsoft 365 services, Teams and Outlook can be deployed with the "
":doc:`embedded Mattermost application </integrations-guide/mattermost-"
"mission-collaboration-for-m365>` for cross-domain partner collaboration "
"within a familiar interface. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 365 데스크톱 앱:** Microsoft 365 서비스를 사용하는 파트너 조직의 "
"경우, 익숙한 인터페이스 내에서 도메인 간 파트너 협업을 위한 :doc:`내장 OKR.BEST "
"애플리케이션 </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-"
"m365>`\\ 과 함께 Teams 및 Outlook을 배포할 수 있습니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Deployments:** Mattermost deployed for sovereign "
"collaboration on private cloud or local infrastructure, such as "
":doc:`Azure </deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>` or `Azure Local"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-local/manage"
"/disconnected-operations-overview>`_, to maintain compliance with STIG, "
"FedRAMP, and NIST 800-53 standards. See :doc:`reference architecture "
"</administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` documentation for "
"Mattermost deployment configurations based on expected scale."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 배포:** STIG, FedRAMP, NIST 800-53 표준 준수를 유지하기 위해 "
":doc:`Azure </deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>` 또는 `Azure Local "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-local/manage/disconnected-"
"operations-overview>`_ 같은 프라이빗 클라우드나 로컬 인프라에서 주권적 협업을 "
"위해 배포된 OKR.BEST입니다. 예상 규모를 기준으로 한 OKR.BEST 배포 구성은 "
":doc:`참조 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` 문서를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Server:** Core application server handling collaboration "
"workloads, including:"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 서버:** 협업 워크로드를 처리하는 핵심 애플리케이션 서버이며, 다음을 "
"포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:73
msgid ""
":doc:`Messaging Collaboration </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`:"
" Sovereign 1:1, group messaging, and structured channel collaboration."
msgstr ""
":doc:`메시지 협업 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`: 주권적 1:1, 그룹 "
"메시지, 구조화된 채널 협업입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:74
msgid ""
":doc:`Workflow Automation </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: "
"Playbooks provide structure, monitoring and automation for repeatable "
"processes built-in to your sovereign Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`워크플로 자동화 </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: Playbooks는 주권적 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장되어 반복 가능한 프로세스에 대한 구조, 모니터링, "
"자동화를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:75
msgid ""
":doc:`Project Tracking </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards"
" enables project management capabilities built-in to your local "
"Mattermost deployment. Boards enables project management capabilities "
"built-in to your sovereign Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`프로젝트 추적 </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards는 로컬 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장된 프로젝트 관리 기능을 제공합니다. Boards는 주권적 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장된 프로젝트 관리 기능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:76
msgid ""
":doc:`AI Agents </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI"
" Agents run against Azure OpenAI endpoints or a self-hosted LLM that is "
"OpenAI-compatible."
msgstr ""
":doc:`AI 에이전트 </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI "
"에이전트는 Azure OpenAI 엔드포인트 또는 OpenAI 호환 셀프 호스팅 LLM에 대해 "
"실행됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:77
msgid ""
":doc:`Audio & Screenshare </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>`: Calls offers native real-time self-hosted audio calls"
" and screen sharing within your own network."
msgstr ""
":doc:`오디오 및 화면 공유 </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>`: Calls는 자체 네트워크 내에서 네이티브 실시간 셀프 호스팅 오디오 통화와 "
"화면 공유를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Proxy Server:** The :doc:`proxy server </deployment-guide/server/setup-"
"nginx-proxy>` handles HTTP(S) routing within the cluster, directing "
"traffic between the server and clients accessing Mattermost services, "
"including requests from users in :doc:`connected organizations "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`. NGINX is "
"recommended for load balancing with support for WebSocket connections, "
"health check endpoints, and sticky sessions. The proxy layer provides SSL"
" termination and distributes client traffic across application servers."
msgstr ""
"**프록시 서버:** :doc:`프록시 서버 </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy>`\\ 는 클러스터 내 HTTP(S) 라우팅을 처리하여 :doc:`연결된 조직 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 의 사용자 요청을 포함해 "
"OKR.BEST 서비스에 접근하는 서버와 클라이언트 간의 트래픽을 전달합니다. WebSocket "
"연결, 상태 점검 엔드포인트, 고정 세션을 지원하는 부하 분산에는 NGINX를 "
"권장합니다. 프록시 계층은 SSL 종료를 제공하고 클라이언트 트래픽을 애플리케이션 "
"서버 전반에 분산합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:81
msgid ""
"**PostgreSQL Database:** Stores persistent application data on a "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13+ database </deployment-guide/server/preparations>`, "
"such as `Azure Database for PostgreSQL <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/products/postgresql>`_."
msgstr ""
"**PostgreSQL 데이터베이스:** `Azure Database for PostgreSQL "
"<https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/postgresql>`_ 같은 "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13 이상 데이터베이스 </deployment-guide/server/preparations>`"
"\\ 에 영구 애플리케이션 데이터를 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Object Storage:** File uploads, images, and attachments are stored "
"outside the application node on an :doc:`S3-compatible store "
"</deployment-guide/server/preparations>` or an NFS (Network File System) "
"server. `Azure Blob Storage <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/products/storage/blobs>`_ can be used, but needs an S3-compatible "
"proxy for Mattermost to interface with."
msgstr ""
"**오브젝트 스토리지:** 파일 업로드, 이미지, 첨부 파일은 :doc:`S3 호환 저장소 "
"</deployment-guide/server/preparations>` 또는 NFS(Network File System) 서버의 "
"애플리케이션 노드 외부에 저장됩니다. `Azure Blob Storage "
"<https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/storage/blobs>`_\\ 를 사용할 수 "
"있지만, OKR.BEST가 연동하려면 S3 호환 프록시가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:85
msgid ""
"**Recording Instance:** ``calls-offloader`` job service, configured using"
" the :doc:`Calls Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` guide, to offload heavy "
"processing tasks from Mattermost Calls, such as recordings, "
"transcriptions, and live captioning, to local infrastructure or private "
"cloud. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**녹화 인스턴스:** :doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-"
"offloader`` 작업 서비스로, 녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 "
"OKR.BEST Calls에서 로컬 인프라나 프라이빗 클라우드로 오프로드합니다. *(선택 "
"사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Integration framework:** :doc:`Custom apps, plugins, and webhooks "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` can be deployed for real-"
"time data integrations and alerting. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**통합 프레임워크:** 실시간 데이터 통합과 알림을 위해 :doc:`사용자 지정 앱, "
"플러그인, 웹훅 </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 을 배포할 수 "
"있습니다. *(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Self-hosted LLM:** Locally hosted :doc:`OpenAI compatible LLM "
"</agents/docs/providers>` for agentic powered collaboration. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**셀프 호스팅 LLM:** 에이전트 기반 협업을 위한 로컬 호스팅 :doc:`OpenAI 호환 LLM "
"</agents/docs/providers>`\\ 입니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Global Network:** `World-wide network "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_ of Microsoft data centers, delivering public cloud services "
"including M365 and Azure OpenAI. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 글로벌 네트워크:** M365와 Azure OpenAI를 포함한 퍼블릭 클라우드 "
"서비스를 제공하는 Microsoft 데이터 센터의 `전 세계 네트워크 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_\\ 입니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:94
msgid "Operational Best Practices"
msgstr "운영 모범 사례"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:96
msgid ""
"The following best practices and deployment configurations help ensure "
"that Mattermost remains secure, resilient, and interoperable across "
"federated mission partner environments."
msgstr ""
"다음 모범 사례와 배포 구성은 페더레이션된 임무 파트너 환경 전반에서 OKR.BEST가 "
"안전하고 복원력 있으며 상호 운용 가능한 상태를 유지하도록 보장하는 데 도움이 "
"됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:99
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "네트워크 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:101
msgid ""
"When external access is enabled through various federation capabilities, "
"it is recommended to deploy Mattermost in a DMZ rather than on the "
"internal network. This approach provides defense-in-depth and preserves "
"security boundaries by isolating each connected server deployment from "
"the enterprise network."
msgstr ""
"다양한 페더레이션 기능을 통해 외부 접근이 활성화되는 경우, OKR.BEST를 내부 "
"네트워크가 아닌 DMZ에 배포할 것을 권장합니다. 이 접근 방식은 심층 방어를 "
"제공하고 각 연결된 서버 배포를 엔터프라이즈 네트워크로부터 격리하여 보안 경계를 "
"보존합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:103
msgid ""
"**DMZ Deployment:** Position Mattermost application servers in the DMZ "
"network segment, allowing both internal users and external partner "
"federation traffic to access the collaboration platform through "
"controlled network boundaries."
msgstr ""
"**DMZ 배포:** OKR.BEST 애플리케이션 서버를 DMZ 네트워크 세그먼트에 배치하여, 내부 "
"사용자와 외부 파트너 페더레이션 트래픽이 모두 제어된 네트워크 경계를 통해 협업 "
"플랫폼에 접근할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:104
msgid ""
"**VPN Termination:** Terminate site-to-site VPN connections at the "
"network perimeter or DMZ layer, enabling encrypted partner connectivity "
"without exposing internal network infrastructure. VPN tunnels establish "
"secure communication channels between partner organizations over the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"**VPN 종료:** 사이트 간 VPN 연결을 네트워크 경계 또는 DMZ 계층에서 종료하여 내부 "
"네트워크 인프라를 노출하지 않고 암호화된 파트너 연결을 가능하게 합니다. VPN "
"터널은 인터넷을 통해 파트너 조직 간에 안전한 통신 채널을 구축합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Firewall Segmentation:** Deploy ingress and egress firewall rules to "
"control traffic flow between the DMZ, internal network, and external "
"partner networks. Restrict database and object storage access to only "
"originate from the DMZ segment where Mattermost servers reside."
msgstr ""
"**방화벽 세분화:** 인그레스 및 이그레스 방화벽 규칙을 배포하여 DMZ, 내부 "
"네트워크, 외부 파트너 네트워크 간의 트래픽 흐름을 제어합니다. 데이터베이스와 "
"오브젝트 스토리지 접근은 OKR.BEST 서버가 위치한 DMZ 세그먼트에서만 시작되도록 "
"제한합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Federation Traffic Isolation:** Partner federation traffic (Connected "
"workspaces synchronize over HTTPS port 443/TCP) remains isolated within "
"the DMZ, protecting internal systems while enabling partner collaboration"
" and enforcing zero-trust principles across organizational boundaries."
msgstr ""
"**페더레이션 트래픽 격리:** 파트너 페더레이션 트래픽(연결된 워크스페이스는 HTTPS "
"포트 443/TCP를 통해 동기화)은 DMZ 내에 격리되어, 내부 시스템을 보호하는 동시에 "
"파트너 협업을 가능하게 하고 조직 경계 전반에 걸쳐 제로 트러스트 원칙을 "
"시행합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:109
msgid "Resilient federation for joint operations"
msgstr "연합 작전을 위한 복원력 있는 페더레이션"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:111
msgid ""
":doc:`Connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>` allow federated collaboration across multiple organizations "
"and networks while maintaining local data control of each Mattermost "
"deployment. Messages, threads, and files are securely synchronized "
"between environments, ensuring mission continuity for multinational "
"operations without requiring partners to join a single centralized "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>`\\ 는 각 OKR.BEST 배포의 로컬 데이터 제어를 유지하면서 여러 조직과 "
"네트워크 전반에 걸쳐 페더레이션 협업을 가능하게 합니다. 메시지, 스레드, 파일은 "
"환경 간에 안전하게 동기화되어, 파트너가 단일 중앙 집중식 배포에 합류할 필요 없이 "
"다국적 작전의 임무 연속성을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:113
msgid ""
"Enforce :ref:`zero-trust access <administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces:create a secure connection>` and ensure that only authorized "
"mission partners can view or contribute to shared collaboration channels."
msgstr ""
":ref:`제로 트러스트 접근 <administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces:create a secure connection>`\\ 을 시행하고, 승인된 임무 파트너만 공유 "
"협업 채널을 보거나 기여할 수 있도록 보장하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:114
msgid ""
"Configure `auto-translation <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-channel-translations>`_ in shared channels for seamless "
"multilingual cross-domain collaboration."
msgstr ""
"매끄러운 다국어 도메인 간 협업을 위해 공유 채널에서 `자동 번역 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-translations>`_\\ 을 "
"구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:115
msgid ""
"Mattermost instances can operate independently during outages or "
"intermittent connectivity and sync conversations once connectivity "
"returns."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 인스턴스는 장애나 간헐적 연결 중에도 독립적으로 작동할 수 있으며, 연결이 "
"복구되면 대화를 동기화합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:117
msgid ""
"Many mission partners continue to operate on legacy systems such as "
"Matrix and XMPP. To enable joint operations without forcing migration, "
"Mattermost supports `secure interoperability "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-bridge>`_ with "
"these environments for continuity of coalition communications while "
"allowing modernized workflows to extend across federated networks."
msgstr ""
"많은 임무 파트너는 Matrix와 XMPP 같은 레거시 시스템에서 계속 운영합니다. "
"마이그레이션을 강요하지 않고 연합 작전을 가능하게 하기 위해, OKR.BEST는 이러한 "
"환경과의 `안전한 상호 운용성 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"matrix-bridge>`_\\ 을 지원하여 연합 통신의 연속성을 보장하면서 현대화된 "
"워크플로가 페더레이션 네트워크 전반으로 확장되도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:119
msgid ""
"Synchronize Mattermost channels with Matrix or XMPP rooms, allowing "
"messages, threads, and attachments to flow across systems in real-time. "
"Each organization maintains control of its data and infrastructure, while"
" interoperability is enabled through federation bridges rather than "
"centralized services."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 채널을 Matrix 또는 XMPP 룸과 동기화하여 메시지, 스레드, 첨부 파일이 "
"실시간으로 시스템 간에 흐르도록 합니다. 각 조직은 자체 데이터와 인프라에 대한 "
"제어권을 유지하며, 상호 운용성은 중앙 집중식 서비스가 아닌 페더레이션 브리지를 "
"통해 가능해집니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:122
msgid "Controlled external access"
msgstr "제어된 외부 접근"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:124
msgid ""
"Mission partner collaboration may require involving external users such "
"as allied forces, contractors, or coalition partners that do not have "
"Mattermost deployments themselves. :doc:`Guest accounts </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` provide a controlled mechanism to enable "
"these users to participate in joint mission operations while maintaining "
"strict compliance and security boundaries."
msgstr ""
"임무 파트너 협업에는 자체 OKR.BEST 배포가 없는 동맹군, 계약업체, 연합 파트너 같은 "
"외부 사용자를 참여시켜야 할 수 있습니다. :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`\\ 은 엄격한 규정 준수와 보안 경계를 유지하면서 "
"이러한 사용자가 연합 임무 작전에 참여할 수 있게 하는 제어된 메커니즘을 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:126
msgid ""
"Guest accounts are restricted to specific teams and channels. This "
"ensures external users only have access to mission-critical resources "
"necessary for their role."
msgstr ""
"게스트 계정은 특정 팀과 채널로 제한됩니다. 이를 통해 외부 사용자는 자신의 역할에 "
"필요한 미션 크리티컬 리소스에만 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:127
msgid ""
"Guests can be granted access to shared channels, enabling collaboration "
"with additional trusted organizations through :doc:`connected workspaces "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`."
msgstr ""
"게스트에게 공유 채널 접근 권한을 부여하여 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 "
"추가 조직과의 협업을 가능하게 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:128
msgid ""
"Guest users can be provided VPN credentials that allow them to connect "
"specifically to the DMZ network segment where Mattermost resides. This "
"architecture ensures external guests can access the collaboration "
"platform without gaining access to internal corporate resources, files, "
"or systems."
msgstr ""
"게스트 사용자에게 OKR.BEST가 위치한 DMZ 네트워크 세그먼트에 특정하여 연결할 수 "
"있는 VPN 자격 증명을 제공할 수 있습니다. 이 아키텍처는 외부 게스트가 내부 기업 "
"리소스, 파일, 시스템에 접근하지 않고 협업 플랫폼에 접근할 수 있도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:131
msgid "Zero-trust access controls"
msgstr "제로 트러스트 접근 제어"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:133
msgid ""
"Mission partner collaboration environments should adopt zero-trust "
"principles by implementing :doc:`attribute-based access control (ABAC) "
"</administration-guide/manage/admin/attribute-based-access-control>` to "
"ensure access to mission channels is governed by dynamic attributes such "
"as role, clearance, location, and mission context."
msgstr ""
"임무 파트너 협업 환경은 :doc:`속성 기반 접근 제어(ABAC) </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/attribute-based-access-control>`\\ 를 구현하여 제로 트러스트 "
"원칙을 채택해야 하며, 이를 통해 임무 채널에 대한 접근이 역할, 보안 등급, 위치, "
"임무 맥락 같은 동적 속성에 의해 통제되도록 보장해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:135
msgid ""
"Restrict channel access based on :doc:`user attributes </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/user-attributes>` rather than static groups."
msgstr ""
"정적 그룹이 아닌 :doc:`사용자 속성 </administration-guide/manage/admin/user-"
"attributes>`\\ 을 기준으로 채널 접근을 제한하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:136
msgid ""
"Continuously audit ABAC policies to ensure compliance with multinational "
"operational and legal requirements."
msgstr ""
"다국적 운영 및 법적 요구 사항 준수를 보장하기 위해 ABAC 정책을 지속적으로 "
"감사하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:139
msgid "Sovereign AI"
msgstr "주권적 AI"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:141
msgid ""
"AI capabilities enhance mission collaboration with summarization, "
"translation, semantic search, and decision support. Sovereign AI ensures "
"these capabilities remain fully under organizational control, without "
"reliance on public cloud services or external data processing. Deploying "
"AI in a self-hosted or compliance-approved environment enables secure, "
"mission-ready augmentation."
msgstr ""
"AI 기능은 요약, 번역, 의미 기반 검색, 의사 결정 지원으로 임무 협업을 향상합니다. "
"주권적 AI는 이러한 기능이 퍼블릭 클라우드 서비스나 외부 데이터 처리에 의존하지 "
"않고 완전히 조직의 제어 아래 유지되도록 보장합니다. 셀프 호스팅 또는 규정 승인 "
"환경에 AI를 배포하면 안전하고 임무에 즉시 활용 가능한 증강이 가능합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:143
msgid ""
"Deploy :doc:`OpenAI compatible language models </administration-"
"guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>` on local or private cloud "
"infrastructure to maintain data sovereignty and ensure offline "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"데이터 주권을 유지하고 오프라인 가용성을 보장하기 위해 로컬 또는 프라이빗 "
"클라우드 인프라에 :doc:`OpenAI 호환 언어 모델 </administration-guide/configure"
"/agents-admin-guide>`\\ 을 배포하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:144
msgid ""
"Configure :ref:`custom agents <administration-guide/configure/agents-"
"admin-guide:agent configuration>` for summarization, workflow automation,"
" and decision support while enforcing organizational compliance policies."
msgstr ""
"조직의 규정 준수 정책을 시행하면서 요약, 워크플로 자동화, 의사 결정 지원을 위해 "
":ref:`사용자 지정 에이전트 <administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-"
"guide:agent configuration>`\\ 를 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:145
msgid ""
"Enable multilingual collaboration in shared channels using sovereign AI "
"services to provide `real-time translations "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-translations>`_ "
"across partner organizations."
msgstr ""
"주권적 AI 서비스를 사용하여 파트너 조직 전반에 `실시간 번역 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-translations>`_\\ 을 "
"제공함으로써 공유 채널에서 다국어 협업을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:146
msgid ""
"Embed AI into operational playbooks for automated task execution, "
"situational summaries, and proactive recommendations."
msgstr ""
"자동화된 작업 실행, 상황 요약, 선제적 권장 사항을 위해 운영 플레이북에 AI를 "
"내장하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:147
msgid ""
"Allow authorized users from partner organizations to securely access "
"locally hosted LLMs through shared channels in :doc:`connected workspaces"
" </administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`."
msgstr ""
"파트너 조직의 승인된 사용자가 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 </administration-guide"
"/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 의 공유 채널을 통해 로컬 호스팅 LLM에 안전하게 "
"접근할 수 있도록 허용하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:150
msgid "High availability and fault tolerance"
msgstr "고가용성 및 내결함성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:152
msgid ""
"Deploy Mattermost in a :doc:`cluster-based architecture </administration-"
"guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>` to ensure "
"continued availability during outages or hardware failures. High "
"availability requires redundant infrastructure across each critical "
"component:"
msgstr ""
"장애나 하드웨어 결함 중에도 지속적인 가용성을 보장하려면 OKR.BEST를 :doc:`클러스터 "
"기반 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-"
"deployment>`\\ 로 배포하세요. 고가용성을 위해서는 각 핵심 구성 요소에 이중화 "
"인프라가 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:154
msgid ""
"Application servers: Scale horizontally across multiple nodes with a load"
" balancer distributing client traffic."
msgstr ""
"애플리케이션 서버: 클라이언트 트래픽을 분산하는 부하 분산기와 함께 여러 노드에 "
"걸쳐 수평으로 확장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:155
msgid ""
"Search service: :ref:`Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch Service "
"<administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>` "
"provides optimized search performance with dedicated indexing for large-"
"scale deployments."
msgstr ""
"검색 서비스: :ref:`Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch Service <administration-"
"guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`\\ 는 대규모 배포를 위한 "
"전용 인덱싱으로 최적화된 검색 성능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:156
msgid ""
"Object storage: Configure S3-compatible backends with erasure coding or "
"replication for durability. All application servers must access shared "
"file storage (NAS or S3) to ensure consistent data availability."
msgstr ""
"오브젝트 스토리지: 내구성을 위해 소거 코딩 또는 복제를 갖춘 S3 호환 백엔드를 "
"구성하세요. 일관된 데이터 가용성을 보장하려면 모든 애플리케이션 서버가 공유 파일 "
"저장소(NAS 또는 S3)에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:157
msgid "Calls services: Run multiple ``rtcd`` and offloader nodes for resilience."
msgstr "Calls 서비스: 복원력을 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 및 offloader 노드를 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:160
msgid "Sovereign audio & screensharing"
msgstr "주권적 오디오 및 화면 공유"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:162
msgid ""
"Deploy :doc:`Mattermost Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>` in a self-hosted configuration to ensure voice and "
"screen sharing capabilities remain operational without reliance on the "
"internet, and that media traffic does not traverse non-compliant third-"
"party services."
msgstr ""
"음성 및 화면 공유 기능이 인터넷에 의존하지 않고 작동하며 미디어 트래픽이 규정을 "
"준수하지 않는 서드파티 서비스를 경유하지 않도록 보장하려면 :doc:`OKR.BEST Calls "
"</administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide>`\\ 를 셀프 호스팅 "
"구성으로 배포하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:164
msgid ""
"The ``rtcd`` service, configured using the :doc:`RTCD Setup and "
"Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` guide, "
"provides scalable, low-latency media routing hosted on-premises. Run "
"multiple ``rtcd`` nodes for redundancy."
msgstr ""
":doc:`RTCD 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` "
"가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``rtcd`` 서비스는 온프레미스에 호스팅되는 확장 가능하고 "
"지연 시간이 짧은 미디어 라우팅을 제공합니다. 이중화를 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 노드를 "
"실행하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:165
msgid ""
"The ``calls-offloader`` service, configured using the :doc:`Calls "
"Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` guide, offloads heavy processing tasks like recording, "
"transcription and live captioning to a compliance-approved job server."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-offloader`` 서비스는 녹화, "
"전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 규정 승인 작업 서버로 "
"오프로드합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:168
msgid "Compliance and retention"
msgstr "규정 준수 및 보존"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:170
msgid ""
"Sovereign environments often require strict enforcement of retention "
"policies, legal hold, and export controls. Configure Mattermost's built-"
"in compliance features to meet organizational mandates."
msgstr ""
"주권적 환경에서는 보존 정책, 법적 보존(legal hold), 내보내기 제어를 엄격하게 "
"시행해야 하는 경우가 많습니다. 조직의 의무를 충족하도록 OKR.BEST의 기본 내장 규정 "
"준수 기능을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:172
msgid ""
"Enable :doc:`compliance export </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"export>` and :doc:`monitoring </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"monitoring>` to produce auditable exports of message data and user "
"activity logs."
msgstr ""
"메시지 데이터와 사용자 활동 로그의 감사 가능한 내보내기를 생성하려면 :doc:`규정 "
"준수 내보내기 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-export>` 및 "
":doc:`모니터링 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-monitoring>`\\ 을 "
"활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:173
msgid ""
"Configure :doc:`message retention </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` and :doc:`legal hold </administration-guide/comply"
"/legal-hold>` policies to align with applicable regulations."
msgstr ""
"적용 가능한 규정에 맞도록 :doc:`메시지 보존 </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` 및 :doc:`법적 보존 </administration-guide/comply/legal-"
"hold>` 정책을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:174
msgid ""
"Integrate with your organization's :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-"
"guide/comply/electronic-discovery>` and archiving systems as required."
msgstr ""
"필요에 따라 조직의 :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-guide/comply/electronic-"
"discovery>` 및 아카이빙 시스템과 통합하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:177
msgid "Mobile notifications"
msgstr "모바일 알림"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:179
msgid ""
"To prevent sensitive message content from being transmitted to external "
"notification services such as Apple Push Notification Service (APNS) and "
"Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), configure Mattermost to use :doc:`ID-only"
" push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-"
"service>`. In this mode, only a message identifier is sent to public push"
" notification services, and the client retrieves the content securely "
"from the Mattermost server over an encrypted channel."
msgstr ""
"민감한 메시지 내용이 Apple Push Notification Service(APNS)나 Firebase Cloud "
"Messaging(FCM) 같은 외부 알림 서비스로 전송되는 것을 방지하려면, OKR.BEST가 "
":doc:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 </deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-"
"service>`\\ 을 사용하도록 구성하세요. 이 모드에서는 메시지 식별자만 퍼블릭 푸시 "
"알림 서비스로 전송되며, 클라이언트는 암호화된 채널을 통해 OKR.BEST 서버에서 "
"내용을 안전하게 가져옵니다."

